# Say Its Name: an Altanak, the Thrice-Called is in Bot1's graveyard and Bot1 does not search the library. "Your graveyard, hand, and/or library" lets it search the hand alone, where
# it need not find anything (CR 701.23b), so it may leave Altanak in the public graveyard, unlike Vision Quest's graveyard searched alone. The cost stays paid, nothing enters, nothing shuffles.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Say Its Name
Island x4
Say Its Name
Say Its Name
Altanak, the Thrice-Called
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Say Its Name.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
Bot1.Graveyard.Say Its Name.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Choose()
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Altanak, the Thrice-Called
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
Exile.Count = 3
Bot1.Shuffles = 0
